<title>HUNGARY: CESI index dips to finih at 1,437.61 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index dips to finih at 1,437.61 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index gave  up 10.73 points or 0.74 percent to 1,437.61 points on Friday, said  the Budapest Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and  Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040.</p>
